<title>czech republic: Czech PX50 rises at fixing.</title>
<headline>Czech PX50 rises at fixing.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech PX50 index rose slightly at Friday's fixing on the Prague bourse despite a mixed performance from major issues.</p>
<p>SPT Telecom fell 12 crowns to 3,358, CEZ rose four crowns to 1,009, Komercni Banka was up 18 crowns to 2,248 and Ceska Sporitelna fell six crowns to 313.  </p>
<p>Overall, 24 shares rose, 19 fell and seven were unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
